  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Text of poem, on coarse light brown paper, is affixed to a long sheet of heavy brown paper. Illustrations, on white paper and hand-colored, are also affixed to the long sheet.  Colophon information, on coarse light brown paper, is affixed to back of sheet.  Two lengths of yarn, one of gray and one of burgundy, are affixed to back of sheet under a glued decoration printed on pink paper creating a loop to serve as a hanger. The whole is folded and stored in an envelope of coarse light brown paper to which are affixed text and illustrations on hand-colored white paper.</subfield>
  </datafield>
